{"seq":2,"slug":"surround-sound","title":"环绕声系统与多声道格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spatial-audio/surround-sound","wordCount":1968,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"环绕声系统与多声道格式\">环绕声系统与多声道格式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>环绕声把声场从前方平面扩展到听者周围，用多通道重建包围感。核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>声道标记 <code>X.Y.Z</code></strong>：X 为耳平面声道数，Y 为 LFE 声道数，Z 为顶部声道数。</li>\n<li><strong>5.1 角色分工</strong>：LCR 承载叙事焦点，环绕声道营造氛围，LFE 仅提供额外 10 dB 低频顶空。</li>\n<li><strong>低频管理（Bass Management）</strong>：将各声道低于约 80 Hz 的内容路由至低音炮，兼顾卫星音箱的能力限制。</li>\n<li><strong>高层声道扩展</strong>：7.1 增加后环绕提升后方定位，7.1.4 引入顶部声道带来垂直维度。</li>\n<li><strong>矩阵编码</strong>：把多声道折叠为两声道传输（如 Dolby Pro Logic II），保留立体声向下兼容。</li>\n<li><strong>混音原则</strong>：对白锚定中置、环境送环绕、LFE 只放极端效果，环绕内容不应吸引注意力。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键取舍是沉浸感与兼容性：声道数越多沉浸感越强，但向下兼容与传输成本随之上升，矩阵编码正是这一矛盾的折中产物。</p>\n<h2 id=\"环绕声的基本理念与历史演进\">环绕声的基本理念与历史演进</h2><p>环绕声（Surround Sound）将声场再现从前方平面扩展到听者周围，通过多个扬声器通道重建空间沉浸感。其核心目标是让听者被声音&quot;包裹&quot;，而非仅在面前感知一条声像线。</p>\n<p>从历史发展看，多声道音频经历了数十年迭代：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时代</th>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>声道配置</th>\n<th>核心技术</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1940s</td>\n<td>Fantasia</td>\n<td>3 声道</td>\n<td>光学胶片</td>\n<td>迪士尼动画</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1970s</td>\n<td>Quadraphonic</td>\n<td>4.0</td>\n<td>矩阵编码</td>\n<td>家庭音乐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1982</td>\n<td>Dolby Surround</td>\n<td>4.0 矩阵</td>\n<td>相位矩阵解码</td>\n<td>影院</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1992</td>\n<td>Dolby Digital</td>\n<td>5.1</td>\n<td>AC-3 压缩</td>\n<td>影院/DVD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1999</td>\n<td>DTS-ES</td>\n<td>6.1</td>\n<td>离散后中</td>\n<td>影院</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2005</td>\n<td>DTS-HD MA</td>\n<td>7.1</td>\n<td>无损编码</td>\n<td>Blu-ray</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2012</td>\n<td>Dolby Atmos</td>\n<td>7.1.4+</td>\n<td>对象音频</td>\n<td>影院/家庭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2019</td>\n<td>MPEG-H</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n<td>场景音频</td>\n<td>广播/VR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>声道标记规则使用 <code>X.Y.Z</code> 格式：X 为耳平面声道数，Y 为 LFE（低频效果）声道数，Z 为顶部声道数。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>总声道数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{总声道数} = X + Y + Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总声道数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[&quot;单声道 1.0&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;立体声 2.0&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;4.0 环绕&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;5.1 标准环绕&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;7.1 扩展环绕&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;7.1.4 沉浸环绕&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;对象音频&lt;br/&gt;无固定声道&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    A[\"单声道 1.0\"] --&gt; B[\"立体声 2.0\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"4.0 环绕\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"5.1 标准环绕\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"7.1 扩展环绕\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"7.1.4 沉浸环绕\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"对象音频&lt;br/&gt;无固定声道\"]</pre><h2 id=\"5-1-环绕声标准\">5.1 环绕声标准</h2><p>5.1 是最广泛部署的环绕声格式，由 ITU-R BS.775 标准定义。六个声道各有明确的声学角色：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>声道</th>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>角度</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>带宽</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>左前</td>\n<td>L</td>\n<td>-30°</td>\n<td>音乐/对白/效果</td>\n<td>全频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中置</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>0°</td>\n<td>对白锚定</td>\n<td>全频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>右前</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>+30°</td>\n<td>音乐/对白/效果</td>\n<td>全频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>左环绕</td>\n<td>Ls</td>\n<td>-110°</td>\n<td>环境/氛围</td>\n<td>全频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>右环绕</td>\n<td>Rs</td>\n<td>+110°</td>\n<td>环境/氛围</td>\n<td>全频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低频效果</td>\n<td>LFE</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>低频增强</td>\n<td>3–120 Hz</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中置声道解决了&quot;幻象中央&quot;的稳定性问题：在纯立体声系统中，偏离 Sweet Spot 的听者会感知中央声像偏移；物理中置音箱确保对白锚定。</p>\n<p>LFE 声道的设计目标是提供额外 10 dB 的低频顶空（Headroom），用于爆炸、撞击等极端低频效果，其截止频率通常为 120 Hz。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LFE 增益</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext> dB（相对主声道满量程）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LFE 增益} = +10\\ \\text{dB（相对主声道满量程）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LFE </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增益</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（相对主声道满量程）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>低频管理（Bass Management）是 5.1 系统的关键环节。当卫星音箱无法再现低频时，低频管理将各声道低于分频点（通常 80 Hz）的信号路由至低音炮：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext>sub</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>LPF</mtext><mn>80</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>LFE</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{\\text{sub}}[n] = \\text{LPF}_{80}\\{L[n] + R[n] + C[n] + Ls[n] + Rs[n]\\} + \\text{LFE}[n]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sub</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LPF</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">80</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LFE</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 主声道[&quot;主声道输入&quot;]&#10;        L[&quot;L&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;C&quot;]&#10;        R[&quot;R&quot;]&#10;        Ls[&quot;Ls&quot;]&#10;        Rs[&quot;Rs&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 管理[&quot;Bass Management&quot;]&#10;        HPF[&quot;高通 80 Hz&lt;br/&gt;送卫星&quot;]&#10;        LPF[&quot;低通 80 Hz&lt;br/&gt;汇总&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    LFE2[&quot;LFE 输入&quot;] --&gt; SUB[&quot;低音炮输出&quot;]&#10;    L --&gt; HPF&#10;    C --&gt; HPF&#10;    R --&gt; HPF&#10;    Ls --&gt; HPF&#10;    Rs --&gt; HPF&#10;    L --&gt; LPF&#10;    C --&gt; LPF&#10;    R --&gt; LPF&#10;    Ls --&gt; LPF&#10;    Rs --&gt; LPF&#10;    LPF --&gt; SUB\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 主声道[\"主声道输入\"]\n        L[\"L\"]\n        C[\"C\"]\n        R[\"R\"]\n        Ls[\"Ls\"]\n        Rs[\"Rs\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 管理[\"Bass Management\"]\n        HPF[\"高通 80 Hz&lt;br/&gt;送卫星\"]\n        LPF[\"低通 80 Hz&lt;br/&gt;汇总\"]\n    end\n    LFE2[\"LFE 输入\"] --&gt; SUB[\"低音炮输出\"]\n    L --&gt; HPF\n    C --&gt; HPF\n    R --&gt; HPF\n    Ls --&gt; HPF\n    Rs --&gt; HPF\n    L --&gt; LPF\n    C --&gt; LPF\n    R --&gt; LPF\n    Ls --&gt; LPF\n    Rs --&gt; LPF\n    LPF --&gt; SUB</pre><h2 id=\"7-1-与高层声道扩展\">7.1 与高层声道扩展</h2><p>7.1 格式在 5.1 基础上增加两个后方声道（Lrs、Rrs），将环绕从单一侧方层拆分为侧环绕（90°–110°）和后环绕（135°–150°），大幅提升后方声像定位精度。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>7.1 声道角度布局:</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{7.1 声道角度布局:}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">7.1 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">声道角度布局</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>声道</th>\n<th>角度（水平）</th>\n<th>仰角</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L</td>\n<td>-30°</td>\n<td>0°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>+30°</td>\n<td>0°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>0°</td>\n<td>0°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LFE</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lss（侧环绕）</td>\n<td>-90°</td>\n<td>0°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rss（侧环绕）</td>\n<td>+90°</td>\n<td>0°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lrs（后环绕）</td>\n<td>-135°</td>\n<td>0°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rrs（后环绕）</td>\n<td>+135°</td>\n<td>0°</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>7.1.4 进一步引入四个顶部声道（Top Front Left/Right、Top Rear Left/Right），实现垂直维度的声像再现。顶部声道通常安装在仰角 30°–45° 的天花板位置，或使用 Dolby Atmos Enabled 音箱的向上发射单元通过天花板反射实现。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>顶部声道仰角:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>–</mtext><mn>45</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{顶部声道仰角:} \\quad \\phi = 30°\\text{–}45°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">顶部声道仰角</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">45°</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 顶部[&quot;天花板层 仰角 30-45度&quot;]&#10;        TFL[&quot;Top Front L&quot;]&#10;        TFR[&quot;Top Front R&quot;]&#10;        TRL[&quot;Top Rear L&quot;]&#10;        TRR[&quot;Top Rear R&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 耳层[&quot;耳平面层&quot;]&#10;        L2[&quot;L -30度&quot;]&#10;        C2[&quot;C 0度&quot;]&#10;        R2[&quot;R +30度&quot;]&#10;        Lss2[&quot;Lss -90度&quot;]&#10;        Rss2[&quot;Rss +90度&quot;]&#10;        Lrs2[&quot;Lrs -135度&quot;]&#10;        Rrs2[&quot;Rrs +135度&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 低频[&quot;地面&quot;]&#10;        SUB2[&quot;LFE 低音炮&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 顶部[\"天花板层 仰角 30-45度\"]\n        TFL[\"Top Front L\"]\n        TFR[\"Top Front R\"]\n        TRL[\"Top Rear L\"]\n        TRR[\"Top Rear R\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 耳层[\"耳平面层\"]\n        L2[\"L -30度\"]\n        C2[\"C 0度\"]\n        R2[\"R +30度\"]\n        Lss2[\"Lss -90度\"]\n        Rss2[\"Rss +90度\"]\n        Lrs2[\"Lrs -135度\"]\n        Rrs2[\"Rrs +135度\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 低频[\"地面\"]\n        SUB2[\"LFE 低音炮\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"声道编码与传输格式\">声道编码与传输格式</h2><p>多声道音频从制作到消费端需要高效的编码传输方案。主流编解码器在压缩效率、延迟和质量间做不同权衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编解码器</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>最大声道</th>\n<th>码率范围</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Dolby Digital (AC-3)</td>\n<td>有损</td>\n<td>5.1</td>\n<td>192–640 kbps</td>\n<td>约 100 ms</td>\n<td>DVD/TV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dolby Digital Plus (E-AC-3)</td>\n<td>有损</td>\n<td>7.1</td>\n<td>32–6144 kbps</td>\n<td>约 100 ms</td>\n<td>流媒体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dolby TrueHD</td>\n<td>无损</td>\n<td>7.1</td>\n<td>约 4–18 Mbps</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>Blu-ray</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DTS</td>\n<td>有损</td>\n<td>5.1</td>\n<td>768–1536 kbps</td>\n<td>约 32 ms</td>\n<td>DVD/BD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DTS-HD MA</td>\n<td>无损</td>\n<td>7.1</td>\n<td>约 24.5 Mbps</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>Blu-ray</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AAC-LC (多声道)</td>\n<td>有损</td>\n<td>7.1</td>\n<td>128–512 kbps</td>\n<td>约 20 ms</td>\n<td>流媒体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FLAC (多声道)</td>\n<td>无损</td>\n<td>8.0</td>\n<td>约 3–6 Mbps</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>存档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>矩阵编码（Matrix Encoding）是一种兼容性技术，将多声道信号折叠入两声道传输，解码端通过相位和电平分析恢复环绕信息。Dolby Pro Logic II 是典型代表：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.707</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.707</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_t = L + 0.707 \\cdot C + 0.707 \\cdot (-j) \\cdot Ls</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.707</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.707</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.707</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.707</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_t = R + 0.707 \\cdot C + 0.707 \\cdot j \\cdot Rs</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.707</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.707</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 表示 90° 相移。这种编码保证了立体声系统的向下兼容——未经解码直接回放时，听者仍能听到所有内容。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;5.1 原始信号&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;矩阵编码器&lt;br/&gt;折叠为 2ch&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Lt / Rt&lt;br/&gt;两声道传输&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D{&quot;解码端&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;Pro Logic 解码&quot;| E[&quot;恢复 5.1&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;直接回放&quot;| F[&quot;立体声兼容&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"5.1 原始信号\"] --&gt; B[\"矩阵编码器&lt;br/&gt;折叠为 2ch\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Lt / Rt&lt;br/&gt;两声道传输\"]\n    C --&gt; D{\"解码端\"}\n    D --&gt;|\"Pro Logic 解码\"| E[\"恢复 5.1\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"直接回放\"| F[\"立体声兼容\"]</pre><h2 id=\"环绕声混音实践\">环绕声混音实践</h2><p>环绕声混音与立体声有本质区别：空间从一维线段扩展为二维或三维球面，声像定位的自由度和复杂性显著增加。</p>\n<p>核心原则：</p>\n<p><strong>前三声道（LCR）承载叙事焦点</strong>：对白固定在中置，主旋律乐器在 LCR 弧线内移动。前方声场的处理方式与立体声混音相似，但中置声道的存在改变了 Pan 策略。</p>\n<p><strong>环绕声道营造氛围</strong>：环境音、房间混响尾音、氛围垫底送入环绕声道。关键是环绕内容不应吸引注意力——一旦听者意识到&quot;后面有声音&quot;，沉浸感反而被打破。</p>\n<p><strong>LFE 仅用于极端低频</strong>：常见错误是将 Bass 乐器路由到 LFE，正确做法是低频乐器通过主声道的低频管理自然下沉到低音炮，LFE 专为超越主声道能力的效果保留。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>混音元素</th>\n<th>声道分配</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>对白</td>\n<td>C 100%</td>\n<td>锚定稳定</td>\n<td>分散到 LR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主旋律</td>\n<td>L/C/R 弧线</td>\n<td>焦点在前</td>\n<td>送环绕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境录音</td>\n<td>Ls/Rs</td>\n<td>自然包裹</td>\n<td>电平过高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混响尾音</td>\n<td>全声道扩散</td>\n<td>空间感</td>\n<td>仅前方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脚步/移动</td>\n<td>动态 Pan</td>\n<td>跟随画面</td>\n<td>跳跃太快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>爆炸 LFE</td>\n<td>LFE + 全声道</td>\n<td>冲击力</td>\n<td>仅 LFE</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>环绕声的声像移动使用发散度（Divergence）控制：当 Divergence = 0 时，声音为点源定位在单一音箱；增加 Divergence 使能量扩散到相邻声道，形成更宽的声像。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i = G_i \\cdot \\left(1 - D + D \\cdot \\frac{1}{N}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为声道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的原始增益，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为发散度（0–1），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为声道总数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>环绕声用多个物理声道把声场扩展到听者周围，声道标记 <code>X.Y.Z</code> 精确描述了耳平面、低频与顶部三个维度的配置。5.1 确立了 LCR 承载焦点、环绕营造氛围、LFE 补充低频顶空的角色分工，低频管理解决了卫星音箱的能力限制。7.1 与 7.1.4 依次增加后方环绕与顶部声道，带来水平与垂直两个方向的定位提升。矩阵编码在扩展声道数的同时保留了立体声兼容性，是沉浸感与兼容性之间的折中。混音实践中，对白锚定中置、环境适度送环绕、LFE 只用于极端效果，是稳定沉浸感的核心原则。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"环绕声系统与多声道格式","id":"环绕声系统与多声道格式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"环绕声的基本理念与历史演进","id":"环绕声的基本理念与历史演进"},{"level":2,"text":"5.1 环绕声标准","id":"5-1-环绕声标准"},{"level":2,"text":"7.1 与高层声道扩展","id":"7-1-与高层声道扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"声道编码与传输格式","id":"声道编码与传输格式"},{"level":2,"text":"环绕声混音实践","id":"环绕声混音实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"立体声原理与声像定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spatial-audio/stereo-principles"},"next":{"title":"沉浸式音频与空间渲染技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spatial-audio/immersive-audio"}}